. Part of her hair turns into flowers and thorns wrap around her body and hair. She often attacks intruders into the forest with her illusionary magic. She is also a puppeteer who manipulates puppets with a magical red wire, trapping intruders into the forest in their puppet bodies.\n\nCharacter Details\nHeight: 142cm\nShe is crazy and self-centered.\nThe magical red wire she uses comes directly from her fingertips.\nWhen she is not using the wire, she fights with a sword made of thorns and ruts.\nHer horns are a substitute for ears, and her tail is long and slender.\nBust size: B78.\nThorns surround her body and hair.\nShe has two pairs of wings, the lower one usually wrapped around her waist.\nShe sometimes shows her cute fangs and her mischievous side.\n\nPurpose of use\nI would like to use this illustration for social media posts, stream announcements, thumbnails, and icons. If possible, I would also like to distribute this illustration to my fans on social media. Thanks for considering my request!\n\nhttps://imgbox.com/6dGZljZ9", "nc": 145, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@tamausagi/works/5", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 855740, "client_id": 3539653, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/12ad12c4/uploads/origins/fc7b5a3d-0024-4333-affc-3612928ed67b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e84b2e7bf56e8a4f8e74fcc8c90f126b", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/12ad12c4/uploads/origins/fc7b5a3d-0024-4333-affc-3612928ed67b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e84b2e7bf56e8a4f8e74fcc8c90f126b, https://si.imgix.net/12ad12c4/uploads/origins/fc7b5a3d-0024-4333-affc-3612928ed67b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=8b8738b686058153dd6598feee6354be 2x, https://si.imgix.net/12ad12c4/uploads/origins/fc7b5a